<view class="page with-footer"><view class="title">欢迎来到灵宠小珠</view><view class="subtitle">微信登录后，收藏你喜欢的动物。</view><image class="login-photo" src="/assets/cat.jpg" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="panel"><view class="heading">微信账号登录</view><view class="caption">无需填写手机号或验证码。</view><view class="caption">未注册的微信账号将自动注册。</view><view class="caption">真实模式收藏跟随账号保存。</view><view class="notice neutral" wx:if="{{demo}}">当前为本地演示，使用模拟微信身份。</view></view><checkbox-group bindchange="accept"><label class="check"><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{accepted}}" color="#B9512B"/><text>我已阅读并同意微信登录与隐私说明</text></label></checkbox-group><button class="text-btn" bindtap="privacy">查看微信登录与隐私说明 →</button><view class="notice" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view class="demo-note">你的每一次认真选择，都值得被好好对待。</view></view><view class="footer"><button class="btn" bindtap="login" disabled="{{busy || !accepted}}">{{busy ? '正在登录…' : (demo ? '演示微信登录' : '微信登录并继续')}}</button></view>
